00:17:26.795 --> 00:17:28.130
their games or whatever, having to

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.131
be able to compete against them.

00:17:29.757 --> 00:17:30.299
I'm excited.

00:17:30.299 --> 00:17:31.800
It's gonna be fun for sure.

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:34.470
And then, and then, now my name is—

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:35.596
I hopped into this league.

00:17:35.596 --> 00:17:38.015
My name is, like, it's hot, but

00:17:38.015 --> 00:17:39.475
it's nothing compared to some of

00:17:39.475 --> 00:17:43.520
these dudes, so I’ll really turn it up.
You feel me? So, it’s lit.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:44.730
- Yeah, nah, that's for sure.

